  "id": "RAW_d62514a103",
  "title": "Vercel WAF for Blob 现已正式发布 - Vercel",
  "url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-waf-for-blob-is-now-generally-available",
  "date": "2026-08-04 01:00:00",
  "author": "Agustin Falco",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Vercel WAF for Blob is now generally available and supported for production use on all plans. If you protected a store <a href=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-waf-for-blob-is-now-in-beta\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-waf-for-blob-is-now-in-beta\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">during the beta</a>, nothing has changed: your rules and setup carry over exactly as they are.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-firewall/vercel-waf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-firewall/vercel-waf\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">Vercel WAF</a> protects a Blob store with <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-firewall/vercel-waf/custom-rules\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-firewall/vercel-waf/custom-rules\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">custom rules</a>, the same kind you use to guard your deployments. Rules that match on properties like IP address, country, and path can deny, challenge, or rate limit requests to your stored objects. This requires no changes to your code, your blob URLs, or how you use <code>@vercel/blob</code>.<!-- --></p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Rules are evaluated at Vercel's edge, so a denied request is turned away before any data transfer occurs. Unwanted traffic to AI-generated media, user uploads, or paid downloads never reaches your store and never generates a bill.</p>\n    <div class=\"[--blog-media-max:clamp(700px,calc(100%+11rem),800px)] [--blog-full-width-media:var(--blog-media-max)] [--blog-full-width-media-used:min(var(--blog-full-width-media),calc(100vw-2*var(--geist-page-margin)))] w-full max-w-none [--article-max-width:640px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 my-10\">\n     <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1wSg82jXbEKt55Qd2kptmz/d70dd3226697bd9a21c0c4ffb4d688f6/509df9dc-518f-4407-b9ca-ce0a677d5573.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1wSg82jXbEKt55Qd2kptmz/d70dd3226697bd9a21c0c4ffb4d688f6/509df9dc-518f-4407-b9ca-ce0a677d5573.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/1wSg82jXbEKt55Qd2kptmz/d70dd3226697bd9a21c0c4ffb4d688f6/509df9dc-518f-4407-b9ca-ce0a677d5573.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Y51xK0ZSw60fHX69zSKhw/154a4a933afff30cdf190eacacb4226a/3f652001-4626-4579-97b1-3d6af869a0cf.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Y51xK0ZSw60fHX69zSKhw/154a4a933afff30cdf190eacacb4226a/3f652001-4626-4579-97b1-3d6af869a0cf.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Y51xK0ZSw60fHX69zSKhw/154a4a933afff30cdf190eacacb4226a/3f652001-4626-4579-97b1-3d6af869a0cf.png\">\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">To enable protection, open your <a href=\"https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F~%2Fstores%2Fblob%2F%5Bstore%5D%2Fsettings\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F~%2Fstores%2Fblob%2F%5Bstore%5D%2Fsettings\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">Blob store's Settings tab</a>, and in the Firewall section select <b>Protect your store</b>, then Enable firewall. This connects the store to a dedicated team-wide project where your Blob firewall rules live, shared by every store you protect.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Read the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-blob/security#firewall-and-waf-integration\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/vercel-blob/security#firewall-and-waf-integration\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">Blob security documentation</a> to protect a store.</p>\n   </div>\n   <section class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) flex flex-col gap-4 mt-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-label-14 font-medium\">Contributors</h2>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-900\">\n     <p class=\"text-copy-14 text-pretty\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kevinsundstrom\" rel=\"author\" target=\"_blank\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 hover:underline\">Kevin Sundstrom</a></p>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel WAF for Blob 现已正式发布，支持通过基于边缘的安全规则保护存储免受异常流量影响并防止产生意外费用。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel WAF for Blob 现已正式发布，支持通过基于边缘的安全规则保护存储免受异常流量影响并防止产生意外费用。",
  "summary": "Vercel 宣布 Vercel WAF for Blob 存储正式发布（GA），现已支持所有方案的生产环境使用。该功能允许开发者使用自定义防火墙规则（如基于 IP、国家/地区和路径的过滤）来保护其 Blob 存储，且无需更改任何代码。由于这些规则在 Vercel 的边缘节点进行评估，未经授权或恶意的请求在数据传输发生前就会被拦截，从而有效防止因 AI 生成媒体、用户上传或大文件下载而产生的意外账单。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "所有方案均已正式发布",
      "explanation": "Vercel WAF for Blob 已结束测试阶段，现已面向所有用户提供生产级支持，现有的测试版配置将无缝迁移。"
    },
    {
      "point": "边缘级请求过滤",
      "explanation": "安全规则在网络边缘进行评估，确保被拒绝的请求在任何数据传输或计费发生之前就被拦截。"
    },
    {
      "point": "灵活的自定义规则",
      "explanation": "用户可以根据 IP 地址、地理位置和特定文件路径等属性，对请求进行拒绝、挑战或速率限制。"
    },
    {
      "point": "无缝集成",
      "explanation": "启用防火墙无需更改应用程序代码、Blob URL 或 @vercel/blob 库的使用方式。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "针对 AI 生成媒体、用户上传或付费下载的异常流量永远不会到达您的存储空间，也不会产生账单。",
    "规则在 Vercel 的边缘进行评估，因此被拒绝的请求在发生任何数据传输之前就会被拦截。"
  ],
